# iter-466 controls2: THE PARITY ROLL (docs/PC_CONTROLS.md 2.6). Keys (player keymap, through the
# action layer) and a ViGEm Xbox 360 pad (the game's native pad path) do the same actions in the same
# session; tools/controls/parity_trace.py compares what the game's commands answered for each pair
# (<out>/actions.jsonl). The mouse cursor drives the front end and the pause menu by direct calls.
# Run: tools/controls/play_roll.ps1 (SR_PORT_FEATURES=1, SR_HARNESS_VPAD=1, the cursor feed).
keymap legacy
await \[NAT_FE\] .256 natural FE master tick 300
tap_until RETURN 250 12000 4 \[APT_LOADMOVIE\].*\("main"\)
await \[APT_REQ\] \S+ path='\.\./common/ButtonHints/XBox360/HintB' 240
wait 10000
vplug
wait 3000
# ── the title: Enter = INTERFACE_A through the action layer (ScrPressStart takes CROSS)
keymap player
press RETURN 300 title-enter
expect claim LoadCreate 20
ifmiss tap_try RETURN 300 3000 4 claim LoadCreate
wait 5000
# ── MAIN MENU by the mouse: wake the cursor, click SETTINGS (row 2), right-click = back
cursor move 600 300
cursor move 640 320
wait 1500
cclickitem 2
expect menu button=2|MOUSE_UI\] call gEH.HandleEvent\(302\) 10
wait 3000
cursor move 600 200
cclick 640 360 right
expect MOUSE_UI\] call gEH.HandleEvent\(304\) 10
wait 3000
# NEW GAME (row 0) by the mouse: hover moves the focus with the focus manager's own step
cursor move 640 330
wait 800
chover 0
expect MOUSE_UI\] call select(Next|Previous)Item 10
wait 1500
cclickitem 0
expect answer cppId=\S+ button=0 10
ifmiss keymap legacy
ifmiss tap Z 250
keymap player
await \[APT_REQ\] \S+ path='screens/hud/main_hud' 180
wait 20000
await_ctx 2 300
wait 6000
# ── gameplay pairs: KEY first, then the same action on the PAD (2 s apart)
press W 900 key-move
wait 2000
vstick l 0 32767 900 pad-move
wait 2500
button left down
watch 400 key-attack
button left up
wait 2000
vpress X 400 pad-attack
wait 2500
press E 300 key-pickup
wait 2000
vpress A 300 pad-pickup
wait 2500
press LEFT SHIFT 800 key-superspeed
wait 2500
vpress RB 800 pad-superspeed
wait 2500
press 2 300 key-power-freeze
wait 2000
vpress RIGHT 300 pad-power-freeze
wait 2500
press F 500 key-superpower
wait 3000
vtrigger r 500 pad-superpower
wait 3000
press LEFT ALT 300 key-dodge
wait 2500
press SPACE 300 key-takeoff
wait 5000
press SPACE 300 key-land
wait 6000
vpress Y 300 pad-takeoff
wait 5000
vpress Y 300 pad-land
wait 6000
# ── pause: Esc (key) / START (pad); back: Esc (key) / B (pad)
press ESCAPE 300 key-pause
expect SR_Log 'pause install' 10
wait 3000
# the pause menu by the mouse: hover row 1 (a focus step), then right-click = back (closes it)
cursor move 600 300
cursor move 640 320
wait 1000
chover 1
expect MOUSE_UI\] call select(Next|Previous)Item 10
wait 1500
cclick 640 360 right
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context gameplay 10
ifmiss press ESCAPE 300 key-back
wait 3000
vpress START 300 pad-pause
expect SR_Log 'pause install' 10
wait 3000
vpress B 300 pad-back
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context gameplay 10
wait 3000
press ESCAPE 300 key-pause2
expect SR_Log 'pause install' 10
wait 2500
press ESCAPE 300 key-back2
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context gameplay 10
wait 3000
# ── map: M (key) / BACK (pad); back: Esc / B
press M 300 key-map
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context menu 10
wait 3000
press ESCAPE 300 key-map-back
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context gameplay 10
wait 3000
vpress BACK 300 pad-map
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context menu 10
wait 3000
vpress B 300 pad-map-back
expect PC_CONTROLS\] context gameplay 10
wait 4000
vunplug
wait 2000
